{"c":[{"name":"20261004T171742Z-362dd90f069eee83","text":"B23: scripts/crash-recovery-eval.ts SIGKILLs a real helper child mid skill run while the script plays reader and host; its 'restarted helper is still running' check is what catches a crash after the last publish (an id collision did exactly that).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T171742Z-7971f1eeb5bd9db9","text":"B23: the reader connects only to a socket whose directory is 0700 and the user's own (never /tmp itself; HelperServer chmods its dir). Tests and evals put sockets in mkdtemp directories.","type":"note"}]}
